    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LD_1LC1RD_0RD0LC_1RA1RC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LD_1LC1RD_0RD0LC_1RA1RC p j' E).
    + lia.
